  vendorName: Magnate Faulkner
  offerText: That giant, dusty portrait of your ancestor is a tragic waste of space.
    Let my men haul it to the dump, and I will give you a few coins for the frame.
  acceptResultText: You take the spare change. The heavy painting is gone, leaving
    your wall wonderfully blank and spacious.
  rejectResultText: You stubbornly keep the massive painting. It continues to take
    up too much space and looks incredibly depressing.
  acceptedDelayedText: 
  rejectedDelayedText: A museum curator visits and identifies your ancestor's portrait
    as a priceless historical artifact! You sell it for an absolute fortune.
